WEBVTT

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.570
Today's the first time DMC's played at such a large venue.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.580
As usual before concerts, I really don't feel like putting my makeup on.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:39.120
Negishi, hurry up and put your makeup on.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:40.040
I don't feel like it right now,

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:41.660
so I'm gonna step out for a quick breather, okay?

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:42.750
I went outside.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.580
And then...

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.680
Negishi-kun?

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.960
Aikawa-san, why are you here?

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:50.130
I came to gather material for the magazine.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.220
But why would such a fashionable magazine bother covering DMC?

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.590
Look.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.850
Amoure Amour readers have voted the #1 worst band as Detroit Metal City.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.770
In the next issue, an Amoure Amour reporter will be sent to attend this band's concert!

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:07.110
I usually like listening to pop singers, like Kahimi Karie.
I do not understand death metal, so I'm kind of nervous.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.610
What are you doing here though?

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:11.110
I'm here on a part-time job.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:11.940
I'm part of the security for this venue sometimes.

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.030
But I really think the band performing today is the worst!

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.950
If you're with security, we might see each other inside.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:16.910
M-Maybe!

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:17.950
I-I've gotta go now!

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:18.200
I'll see you later!

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:18.620
Dammit!

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:19.740
D-Do your best.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.660
I never expected Aikawa-san to come to our concert!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.910
For real man, get your shit ready.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.710
We're going on soon.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.830
I never knew that Amoure Amour's readers hated DMC so much...

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:29.380
If Aikawa-san discovers my identity today, it'll be the end of our relationship!

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:30.380
If she finds out, it's all over!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.590
It'll be all over!

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:33.840
I cannot let her find out!

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.760
Dude, that makeup is sick!

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:36.970
You're finally starting to get into this, aren't ya?

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:37.930
I-I guess.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:38.680
Yeah.

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:40.890
Okay then, we're gonna the
"Letters From Hell" as the opening.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.680
I'll be "D," Krauser's "M," and Camus is "C."

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:43.270
Eh?

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:45.020
Do we have to?

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.060
I don't wanna be "M."

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:46.650
Shut up, bitch.

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:47.900
Just do it, and let's all try to do it together.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.440
Also, you're gonna give a slight intermission between songs so we don't get too tired.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.190
I am thankful to music...

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:53.240
Hey, they're gonna play "Grotesque!"

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:57.620
Without it, I would have become just another mass murderer... "Grotesque."

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:58.160
I knew it.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.490
But I can't think up shit on the spot!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:00.950
Little wimp.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.950
Dumbass! This is our first huge concert!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.210
Tonight, we have to give our best performance ever!

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.710
Let's roll out!

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:10.040
I wonder what kind of concert this will be like...

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.300
I'm kind of worried.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.050
And what's this "Go to DMC" about anyways?

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.090
Hey, they're coming out!

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.590
Look!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.970
It's DMC!

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:20.930
Oh my god!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.520
Anyone who lays eyes on those letters will be cursed!

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.920
They're DMC's "Letters From Hell!"

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:25.940
Curse me!
They're DMC's "Letters From Hell!"

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:26.770
Fuckin' awesome!

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:28.520
Is it me, or is Krauser-san shaking a little?!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.770
He's just showing off his manliness!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.570
Why the hell did I have to be "M?"

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:32.780
It's totally embarrassing and making me tired!

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:35.320
At this rate, I won't be able to spot Aikawa-san here!

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.570
Krauser-san, your face looks different today!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.910
The Emperor is finally about to give orders to his slaves!

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.870
What's with that pose?

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.290
I don't understand why they're doing it.

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.750
Where are you, Aikawa-san?!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.420
Negishi's totally the bomb!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.270
Despite his whining, he knows how to fuckin' rock all out on stage!

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:00.600
Could she be in the back?

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.220
Where is she?

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.180
Where?!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.890
Where is that bitch hiding?!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.390
That fucking bitch!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.520
Get your ass out here, you fucking bitch!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.230
Where are you?!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:13.440
Show yourself!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.530
Wh-What's he doing?

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.030
Scary...

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.320
He's looking for someone...

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:18.030
Dead man walking...

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.530
This MCing is awesome!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.700
It's like he's a beast searching for his prey!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.200
I knew it, you are a metal monster, Negishi!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:26.870
Let's do it!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.720
"Grotesque!"

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:38.170
I really can't think of anything good to say about them.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:42.300
Forget gathering material, I can barely stand to listen to this...

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:46.220
Negishi-kun said he was with security, but where is he?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.270
The next song is our newest creation, "Symphony of the Bitch Pig!"

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.980
A-Aikawa-san!

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.050
Come over here!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.930
Wait! I don't want to go over to her!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:25.390
Shit, I'm getting closer to Aikawa-san!

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:26.470
Take me back to the stage!

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.390
Hey, stop!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.450
Stop!

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.060
Oh shit, my wig's slipping off!

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:33.060
It's over!

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:37.040
I can't move, and it's all over if she looks up!

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:41.090
This is the lower body of this pig!

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.860
Tonight's sacrifice will be this bitch pig!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.530
Krauser fuckin' rules!

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.950
I can't take it anymore!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.840
The pig ran away!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.960
I'm going home now.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.590
You were awesome tonight!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.750
You really are the godsend of death metal!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.170
No, I'm the worst.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.380
I sacrificed Aikawa-san to protect myself...

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.030
I have to find a way to apologize to her...

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.680
Aikawa-san!

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:06.850
Negishi-kun...

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.310
What's the matter?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.680
Did something happen during the concert?

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.140
I was posted outside so...

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.520
No, I'm okay.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.600
I-If you'd like, would you like to go to dinner with me?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.400
I'll use the money I earned tonight, so it's on me.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.570
Oh, really?

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:20.610
I know a place nearby that has a great pork dish.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:21.070
Pork?!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.650
Oh shit!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.570
I called her a pig during the concert!

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.660
Why?! Why pork?!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:26.320
N-No...

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.660
Do I remind you of a pig?!

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:27.730
There's no way I'd ever associate you with a pig!

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.680
Am I really that fat?!
There's no way I'd ever associate you with a pig!

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:30.120
There's no way I'd ever associate you with a pig!

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:33.960
Despite my horrendous crimes, I was able to treat Aikawa-san to Korean BBQ.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.960
A few days later, I picked up Amoure Amour's latest issue...

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:38.630
They're really a terrible band.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.960
They were shouting loudly like pigs, and I could hardly hear a thing.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.970
The vocalist in particular was a terrible man.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.390
Looks like she's still a bit sensitive about being called a pig...

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:48.850
This week's worst band report was done at a Detroit Metal City concert.

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:51.390
The caption under the picture is labeled "pig," but that's actually Krauser-san!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:56.020
Today, Krauser II went to Death Records to engage in a solo interview,

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.480
only to incur the president's onslaught afterwards.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.900
What music do you typically listen to?

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.530
Kahi-, no, I listen to Hell style music.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:04.400
I managed to reply in a Krauser-esque fashion.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.450
Okay then. What's your favorite food?

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.870
Omelette rice, but with human blood instead of ketchup.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.040
But I'm pretty sure it didn't go well.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.500
It's okay though.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.080
I don't know anything about the death metal lifestyle.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.040
All that stuff leaves my mind once I get home.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.710
I feel like watching a French movie, just for a change of mood.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.130
Hey, Negishi.

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:23.090
We're here to change your lifestyle.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:24.130
Pre-President?!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.300
Oh shit.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:27.090
What's with this puny-ass room?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:27.370
What are you doing with all that money of yours?

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:29.680
Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing here?!

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:30.710
At least take off your shoes!

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:31.010
Hey.
At least take off your shoes!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.390
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:33.560
Who are these guys?!

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.390
My comrades in metal, Guri and Gura.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.940
Negishi, what the fuck was up with that interview today?

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:39.520
Make sure that shit doesn't happen again...

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.440
We've come to reeducate you into a full-blown death metal fucker.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.330
Owwie, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.570
Negishi, bring us some drinks.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.990
I'm giving you tea, but please leave afterwards.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.070
Th-This is the worst.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.830
Given, today's interview went pretty bad,

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.040
but there's no way I could live a death metal lifestyle.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.620
Hey, Soui-chan.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.080
I heard some screaming just now. Is everything okay?

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.210
Oh, it's Grampa Shige from next door.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.710
I-I'm sorry about the noise. My friends are visiting.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.880
We got a bit carried away.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.670
I see, I see. Ain't it nice to be young and feisty?

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.800
I thought something bad happened to you.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.930
Excuse me.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.800
Grampa Shige was concerned for my well-being...

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.640
He's the manager of the apartment,

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.740
and he's taken care of me ever since I was in college.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:19.150
He's kinda been like my Tokyo Grandpa.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.980
I've grown quite attached to the apartment.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.480
Even though my place is pretty small, I want to take really good care of it.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.360
Hey guys, the tea's ready.

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.280
I hope you like apple tea.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:27.740
Yeah, that's perfect.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.860
Yeah, do it on the top of the poster.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.820
President, make them stop!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:32.530
What the hell...

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.700
We ain't gonna drink that shit!

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:34.960
Hot, ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:37.010
Hey guys, go get the booze.

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:42.380
My room, which I've dedicated years of care, is being desecrated.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.630
Who the fuck's this?

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:44.130
Your mom?

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:44.500
Yeah.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:47.300
That's a picture from when we went sightseeing around Tokyo in a tour bus.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.130
She probably reeks.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.800
I bet she was a slut in her younger days.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.930
I don't want to think about that, let alone hear it!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.390
Hey Negishi, put on some music.

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:56.100
I can't take this anymore.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.910
Let's calm down this madness with some music.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.770
French music is really relaxing.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.020
I'm really glad I bought this CD.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:01.520
Hey.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.250
My CD!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.070
Listening to that shit is what makes you suck so much.

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.460
Put on some DMC.

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.150
Now this is living.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.780
President, there's an elderly person living next door.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.910
Please turn the music down.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.870
For explosive music like this, weed is the best shit.

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:14.850
I'm gonna get high...

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:15.450
Eh?
I'm gonna get high...

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:18.700
D-Don't tell me that those guys are smoking the same thing...!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.000
I-Is this what they call a drug party?!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.830
These guys are doing illegal things in my room!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.630
C'mon Negishi, ya need to smoke it too.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.920
I'm just fine with my apple tea!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:30.050
Hey, aren't you the guy who composed
"I Invented Narcotics," and sang it with DMC?!

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.130
Now smoke it you pansy!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:31.880
Okay...

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.930
Alright, then I'll just pretend to smoke it without inhaling any.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.810
Fake smoking, fake smoking...

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.770
Oh... I think I'm like totally high.

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:38.600
I think stoners are like this...

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.600
Guess there wasn't enough kick in that.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.020
Let's try for an injection then.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.390
Holy shit, I'm near my breaking point!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.600
Oh, now it's working.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.980
Hey, where the fuck am I?!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.480
Let's go nuts, Negishi!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.620
Th-That was close!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.320
Sounds like you're having a lot of fun here.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.900
Grampa Shige, I'm so sorry.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:52.700
The music's too loud, isn't it?

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:53.530
Not at all.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:54.870
It's good to be young after all.

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:57.950
Here're some fried dough cakes. Eat them with your friends.

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:58.870
Thank you for your kind gesture.

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:01.210
Old timer, y'think we'll eat that stuff?

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:01.790
Pre-President!

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:03.290
Come with me, old timer.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.710
C'mon, Guri and Gura.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.340
Young people sure are strong.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:07.460
President, please stop!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.400
Hey boys, I already took a bath!

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.840
Strip him bare!
Hey boys, I already took a bath!

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.470
My eyes are spinning!

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:13.090
C'mon Negishi, it's your turn.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.050
No, I don't want to! I can't!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.550
I knew it, you aren't high, are you?!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.600
What's this?! I think there's gold locked inside these vaults!

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:18.510
C'mon dudes, what's the combination for the dials?!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.470
Soui-chan, that's my nipple...

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.020
I'm so sorry...

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:23.440
You're having a hallucination!

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.650
You really are high!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:25.690
Grampa Shige, forgive me!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:26.860
Hey dudes, I'm getting a boner!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:30.280
Soui-chan, being around people your own age really does give you a lot of energy, doesn't it?

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.280
Let me do you, Gramps!

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.570
You shriveled up old fart!

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:35.200
Dude, you've totally gone off the fuckin' deep end!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.320
I'm so sorry for this, Grampa Shige!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.410
Feels good, doesn't it you old fart?!

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.010
My fried dough cake's ramming your ass!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:43.660
This is fuckin' awesome!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.920
I'm totally soaked!

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.790
Eventually, dawn broke.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.590
The next day...

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:51.260
Later Negishi.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.110
Don't forget what we did last night, and live like a true metal fiend!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:59.010
After the president left, Negishi inspected his room.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:02.930
Let's see what happened after all the posters and pictures of artists and all things stylish

