00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:13.440
Obscenities drawn with spray paint covered the walls, and gave the room a grotesque feeling.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:21.740
The TV and DVD player Negishi treasured can no longer be used to watch the French film he wanted to see...

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:26.460
as the president had suggested to have the TV skewered, for the eerie static sound

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:30.170
