00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:38.470
A futon, with an ordinary stripe pattern, and a very soft pillow had rapidly changed into...

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:40.470
charred remains of what used to be a bed.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:43.350
With the many sleepless nights to follow,

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:46.100
it's quite easy to see why the owner of the bed would gradually lean towards killing people.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.020
